  "source_title": "钱学森\n美国嘲笑中国造不出导弹，15年后，东风快递让他们集体闭嘴。\n\n#钱学森 #中国导弹之父 #国之脊梁 #国士无双 #人民科学家 #读书感悟 #文字共鸣 #情感共鸣 #名人故事",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 432.889002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "美国人说，他一个人抵得上五个师。后来他们才发现这句话说小了，家人们先说一句，提气的话，有句话说的特别好，手里没有剑和有剑，不用是两回事。今天讲的这个人就是给咱们中国人递荐的人，他叫钱钱学森。一九五五年，当钱学森终于回到祖国的时候，美国人还在嘴硬，说放他回去又怎么样，中国连手扶拖拉机都造不明白，他一个人能翻起什么浪。当时谁也没想到，这句话成了美国人在整个冷战里最大的一个笑话。钱学森回国之后干的第一件大事是一九五五年冬天在哈尔滨陈赓大将问他，钱先生，您看咱们中国人自己搞导弹行不行？钱学森只回了一句，怎么不行，外国人能搞的，中国人为什么不能搞？我们中国人不比他们矮一截，就这一句话定下了中国国防现代化的乾坤。可话说回来，那会儿搞导弹拿什么搞家人们，您知道当时的条件有多苦吗？没有图纸，没有设备，没有专家，整个中国真正见过导弹的人，一只手数得过来。钱学森手里有什么一支笔、一张纸和一屋子刚毕业的年轻人。一九五六年，国防部第五研究院成立，这是中国第一个导弹研究机构。一开始，全院就几百号人办公地点是几间旧房子。钱学森亲自给这群年轻人上课，从最基础的讲起，他出的考题，据说难道没几个人能及格？可就是这样，他硬是在一群学生兵里带出了中国导弹事业的班底。那时候算导弹弹道，没有计算机，全靠算盘，手摇计算机。一屋子人噼里啪啦打一整天，钱学森就是带着这群年轻人，用最原始的工具算出了中国人自己的导弹数据。一九六零年十一月五号，中国第一枚近程导弹东风一号发射成功。从五院成立到导弹，上天四年，美国人听说这个消息的时候，下巴差点没掉下来，但这才哪到哪。一九六四年十月十六号，中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功。一九六六年十月二十七号，钱学森给原子弹装上了翅膀。导弹载着核弹头，从戈壁滩腾空而起，准确命中预定目标，两弹结合，试验成功。那一年距离他回国才十一年。一九六七年氢弹爆炸。一九七零年四月二十四号，东方红一号卫星上天，东方红的乐曲响彻太空家人们，您把这些时间线排在一起看看，从一无所有到两弹一星全部拿下来，中间隔了多久？十五年十五年前，美国人说他一个人翻不起浪。十五年后，中国人手里已经有了一把谁都动不了的剑。这就是从零到一的可怕。美国人当年为什么宁可关他五年也不放他？因为他们太清楚了，像钱学森这种人一个就能顶一支军队，他完成的不是仿制，不是追赶，是开创，更觉得是他超前的眼光。今天让全世界都头疼的。东风时期高超音速导弹用的那个钱学森弹道，不是普通抛物线，是助推加滑翔，飞着飞着还能变鬼道，让所有防空系统都摸不着头脑。这个理论底子钱学森早在几十年前就画出来了，美国研究了这么多年，到现在也没完全吃透。写到这儿，我还想跟您提一个人。郭有怀，他跟钱学森是好友。也是一九五六年前后冲破阻挠回国的顶尖科学家两弹一星的元勋。一九六八年十二月五号，郭永怀从青海基地赶回北京，汇报一起飞机失事。人们找到他和警卫员遗体的时候，发现两个人紧紧抱在一起，怀里护着的公文包完好无损，里面装的是热核导弹的绝密数据。那一年，他五十九岁家人们，中国导弹事业，这条路上不只是钱学森，一个人，是无数个像郭永怀这样把命都搭进去的人才，让咱们今天能挺直腰杆说话。美国人说，钱学森抵得上五个师才在回头看。这句话缩小了，他给中国带来的是一个完整的国防工业体系，是一整代能打仗的科学家队伍，是往后几十年的和平家人们。您记住今天这个日子里的每一个名字，他们那一代人把建筑好了，咱们这一代人才有资格说我们爱好和平，因为和平是手里的剑给的。听完他的故事，心里真的很感慨，咱们现在安稳的日子，那是凭空来的，都是这一批国之先辈，吃苦受累，咬牙扛出来。很多时候，我们生活里遇到点难处，就容易觉得累，觉得委屈。回头看看这些先辈，他当年面临的是更大的苦难和抉择。读他们的故事，不是单纯看历史，更是读懂。什么叫骨气？什么叫担当？这本国之几两？就在左下角链接里书里面记录的就是这些近代先辈们真实的人生。没事的时候翻一翻，不管是自己看，家里孩子也可以读一读，了解我们真正的民族榜样，有需要的朋友直接拍下现货，带回家，慢慢品读。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1010,
      "text": "美国人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1010,
      "end_ms": 3270,
      "text": "他一个人抵得上五个师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3270,
      "end_ms": 7050,
      "text": "后来他们才发现这句话说小了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7050,
      "end_ms": 9010,
      "text": "家人们先说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9030,
      "end_ms": 10650,
      "text": "提气的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10650,
      "end_ms": 12550,
      "text": "有句话说的特别好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12570,
      "end_ms": 15330,
      "text": "手里没有剑和有剑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15330,
      "end_ms": 17050,
      "text": "不用是两回事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17850,
      "end_ms": 21870,
      "text": "今天讲的这个人就是给咱们中国人递荐的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22730,
      "end_ms": 24930,
      "text": "他叫钱钱学森。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24930,
      "end_ms": 26790,
      "text": "一九五五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26870,
      "end_ms": 29870,
      "text": "当钱学森终于回到祖国的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29870,
      "end_ms": 30940,
      "text": "美国人还在嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31080,
      "end_ms": 32440,
      "text": "说放他回去又怎么样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33240,
      "end_ms": 35740,
      "text": "中国连手扶拖拉机都造不明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35740,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "他一个人能翻起什么浪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38840,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "当时谁也没想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41180,
      "end_ms": 47100,
      "text": "这句话成了美国人在整个冷战里最大的一个笑话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48540,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "钱学森回国之后干的第一件大事是一九五五年冬天在哈尔滨陈赓大将问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00020",
      "start_ms": 58200,
      "end_ms": 58900,
      "text": "钱先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59120,
      "end_ms": 63515,
      "text": "您看咱们中国人自己搞导弹行不行？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64640,
      "end_ms": 66355,
      "text": "钱学森只回了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67490,
      "end_ms": 68135,
      "text": "怎么不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00024",
      "start_ms": 68580,
      "end_ms": 69695,
      "text": "外国人能搞的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00025",
      "start_ms": 69930,
      "end_ms": 71355,
      "text": "中国人为什么不能搞？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71750,
      "end_ms": 74340,
      "text": "我们中国人不比他们矮一截，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00027",
      "start_ms": 74420,
      "end_ms": 79405,
      "text": "就这一句话定下了中国国防现代化的乾坤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00028",
      "start_ms": 80340,
      "end_ms": 81405,
      "text": "可话说回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00029",
      "start_ms": 82250,
      "end_ms": 86505,
      "text": "那会儿搞导弹拿什么搞家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00030",
      "start_ms": 87870,
      "end_ms": 90195,
      "text": "您知道当时的条件有多苦吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00031",
      "start_ms": 90770,
      "end_ms": 91535,
      "text": "没有图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00032",
      "start_ms": 91940,
      "end_ms": 92745,
      "text": "没有设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00033",
      "start_ms": 93040,
      "end_ms": 93845,
      "text": "没有专家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00034",
      "start_ms": 94320,
      "end_ms": 97245,
      "text": "整个中国真正见过导弹的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00035",
      "start_ms": 97560,
      "end_ms": 99095,
      "text": "一只手数得过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00036",
      "start_ms": 99760,
      "end_ms": 105985,
      "text": "钱学森手里有什么一支笔、一张纸和一屋子刚毕业的年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00037",
      "start_ms": 106550,
      "end_ms": 107555,
      "text": "一九五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00038",
      "start_ms": 107880,
      "end_ms": 109865,
      "text": "国防部第五研究院成立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00039",
      "start_ms": 110410,
      "end_ms": 112830,
      "text": "这是中国第一个导弹研究机构。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00040",
      "start_ms": 112910,
      "end_ms": 113605,
      "text": "一开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00041",
      "start_ms": 114430,
      "end_ms": 118675,
      "text": "全院就几百号人办公地点是几间旧房子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00042",
      "start_ms": 119650,
      "end_ms": 122515,
      "text": "钱学森亲自给这群年轻人上课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00043",
      "start_ms": 123270,
      "end_ms": 125085,
      "text": "从最基础的讲起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00044",
      "start_ms": 125800,
      "end_ms": 126865,
      "text": "他出的考题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127500,
      "end_ms": 129735,
      "text": "据说难道没几个人能及格？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00046",
      "start_ms": 130220,
      "end_ms": 130965,
      "text": "可就是这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00047",
      "start_ms": 131400,
      "end_ms": 136465,
      "text": "他硬是在一群学生兵里带出了中国导弹事业的班底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00048",
      "start_ms": 137410,
      "end_ms": 138970,
      "text": "那时候算导弹弹道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00049",
      "start_ms": 139230,
      "end_ms": 140210,
      "text": "没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00050",
      "start_ms": 140370,
      "end_ms": 141355,
      "text": "全靠算盘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141700,
      "end_ms": 142775,
      "text": "手摇计算机。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00052",
      "start_ms": 143470,
      "end_ms": 145745,
      "text": "一屋子人噼里啪啦打一整天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00053",
      "start_ms": 146690,
      "end_ms": 149165,
      "text": "钱学森就是带着这群年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00054",
      "start_ms": 149400,
      "end_ms": 154435,
      "text": "用最原始的工具算出了中国人自己的导弹数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00055",
      "start_ms": 155490,
      "end_ms": 157495,
      "text": "一九六零年十一月五号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00056",
      "start_ms": 158290,
      "end_ms": 165215,
      "text": "中国第一枚近程导弹东风一号发射成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00057",
      "start_ms": 165750,
      "end_ms": 168000,
      "text": "从五院成立到导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00058",
      "start_ms": 168000,
      "end_ms": 169435,
      "text": "上天四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00059",
      "start_ms": 170130,
      "end_ms": 172195,
      "text": "美国人听说这个消息的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172520,
      "end_ms": 174075,
      "text": "下巴差点没掉下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00061",
      "start_ms": 174630,
      "end_ms": 175785,
      "text": "但这才哪到哪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00062",
      "start_ms": 176400,
      "end_ms": 178715,
      "text": "一九六四年十月十六号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179280,
      "end_ms": 182005,
      "text": "中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00064",
      "start_ms": 182710,
      "end_ms": 184925,
      "text": "一九六六年十月二十七号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00065",
      "start_ms": 185570,
      "end_ms": 188610,
      "text": "钱学森给原子弹装上了翅膀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00066",
      "start_ms": 188690,
      "end_ms": 190205,
      "text": "导弹载着核弹头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00067",
      "start_ms": 190640,
      "end_ms": 192865,
      "text": "从戈壁滩腾空而起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00068",
      "start_ms": 193230,
      "end_ms": 195035,
      "text": "准确命中预定目标，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00069",
      "start_ms": 195490,
      "end_ms": 196270,
      "text": "两弹结合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00070",
      "start_ms": 196270,
      "end_ms": 196985,
      "text": "试验成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00071",
      "start_ms": 197470,
      "end_ms": 200835,
      "text": "那一年距离他回国才十一年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00072",
      "start_ms": 201200,
      "end_ms": 203225,
      "text": "一九六七年氢弹爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00073",
      "start_ms": 203730,
      "end_ms": 206425,
      "text": "一九七零年四月二十四号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00074",
      "start_ms": 206820,
      "end_ms": 209115,
      "text": "东方红一号卫星上天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00075",
      "start_ms": 209690,
      "end_ms": 214115,
      "text": "东方红的乐曲响彻太空家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00076",
      "start_ms": 215010,
      "end_ms": 217775,
      "text": "您把这些时间线排在一起看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00077",
      "start_ms": 218250,
      "end_ms": 222815,
      "text": "从一无所有到两弹一星全部拿下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00078",
      "start_ms": 223370,
      "end_ms": 224555,
      "text": "中间隔了多久？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00079",
      "start_ms": 224880,
      "end_ms": 226990,
      "text": "十五年十五年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00080",
      "start_ms": 227330,
      "end_ms": 229655,
      "text": "美国人说他一个人翻不起浪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00081",
      "start_ms": 230060,
      "end_ms": 231005,
      "text": "十五年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00082",
      "start_ms": 231370,
      "end_ms": 235705,
      "text": "中国人手里已经有了一把谁都动不了的剑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00083",
      "start_ms": 236270,
      "end_ms": 238685,
      "text": "这就是从零到一的可怕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00084",
      "start_ms": 239640,
      "end_ms": 243435,
      "text": "美国人当年为什么宁可关他五年也不放他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00085",
      "start_ms": 243920,
      "end_ms": 245305,
      "text": "因为他们太清楚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00086",
      "start_ms": 245610,
      "end_ms": 250405,
      "text": "像钱学森这种人一个就能顶一支军队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00087",
      "start_ms": 251210,
      "end_ms": 253275,
      "text": "他完成的不是仿制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00088",
      "start_ms": 253560,
      "end_ms": 254385,
      "text": "不是追赶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00089",
      "start_ms": 254650,
      "end_ms": 255355,
      "text": "是开创，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00090",
      "start_ms": 256200,
      "end_ms": 258665,
      "text": "更觉得是他超前的眼光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00091",
      "start_ms": 259210,
      "end_ms": 261490,
      "text": "今天让全世界都头疼的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00092",
      "start_ms": 261490,
      "end_ms": 266495,
      "text": "东风时期高超音速导弹用的那个钱学森弹道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266780,
      "end_ms": 268120,
      "text": "不是普通抛物线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00094",
      "start_ms": 268200,
      "end_ms": 270025,
      "text": "是助推加滑翔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00095",
      "start_ms": 270370,
      "end_ms": 272415,
      "text": "飞着飞着还能变鬼道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00096",
      "start_ms": 272730,
      "end_ms": 275075,
      "text": "让所有防空系统都摸不着头脑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00097",
      "start_ms": 276020,
      "end_ms": 280225,
      "text": "这个理论底子钱学森早在几十年前就画出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00098",
      "start_ms": 280750,
      "end_ms": 282325,
      "text": "美国研究了这么多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00099",
      "start_ms": 282630,
      "end_ms": 284935,
      "text": "到现在也没完全吃透。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00100",
      "start_ms": 285890,
      "end_ms": 286595,
      "text": "写到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00101",
      "start_ms": 286950,
      "end_ms": 288515,
      "text": "我还想跟您提一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00102",
      "start_ms": 288820,
      "end_ms": 289485,
      "text": "郭有怀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00103",
      "start_ms": 290380,
      "end_ms": 292285,
      "text": "他跟钱学森是好友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00104",
      "start_ms": 292690,
      "end_ms": 299430,
      "text": "也是一九五六年前后冲破阻挠回国的顶尖科学家两弹一星的元勋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00105",
      "start_ms": 300070,
      "end_ms": 301930,
      "text": "一九六八年十二月五号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00106",
      "start_ms": 302090,
      "end_ms": 305150,
      "text": "郭永怀从青海基地赶回北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00107",
      "start_ms": 305150,
      "end_ms": 306890,
      "text": "汇报一起飞机失事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00108",
      "start_ms": 307790,
      "end_ms": 310670,
      "text": "人们找到他和警卫员遗体的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00109",
      "start_ms": 311090,
      "end_ms": 313470,
      "text": "发现两个人紧紧抱在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00110",
      "start_ms": 313950,
      "end_ms": 317010,
      "text": "怀里护着的公文包完好无损，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00111",
      "start_ms": 317850,
      "end_ms": 322285,
      "text": "里面装的是热核导弹的绝密数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00112",
      "start_ms": 322830,
      "end_ms": 323430,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00113",
      "start_ms": 323730,
      "end_ms": 326410,
      "text": "他五十九岁家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00114",
      "start_ms": 327770,
      "end_ms": 329110,
      "text": "中国导弹事业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00115",
      "start_ms": 329110,
      "end_ms": 332170,
      "text": "这条路上不只是钱学森，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00116",
      "start_ms": 332190,
      "end_ms": 332690,
      "text": "一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00117",
      "start_ms": 333110,
      "end_ms": 338030,
      "text": "是无数个像郭永怀这样把命都搭进去的人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00118",
      "start_ms": 338030,
      "end_ms": 340890,
      "text": "让咱们今天能挺直腰杆说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00119",
      "start_ms": 341750,
      "end_ms": 342350,
      "text": "美国人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00120",
      "start_ms": 342350,
      "end_ms": 345430,
      "text": "钱学森抵得上五个师才在回头看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00121",
      "start_ms": 345470,
      "end_ms": 347050,
      "text": "这句话缩小了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00122",
      "start_ms": 347910,
      "end_ms": 353270,
      "text": "他给中国带来的是一个完整的国防工业体系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00123",
      "start_ms": 353500,
      "end_ms": 356595,
      "text": "是一整代能打仗的科学家队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00124",
      "start_ms": 357420,
      "end_ms": 360525,
      "text": "是往后几十年的和平家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00125",
      "start_ms": 360810,
      "end_ms": 363705,
      "text": "您记住今天这个日子里的每一个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00126",
      "start_ms": 364230,
      "end_ms": 366585,
      "text": "他们那一代人把建筑好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00127",
      "start_ms": 366820,
      "end_ms": 371145,
      "text": "咱们这一代人才有资格说我们爱好和平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00128",
      "start_ms": 371750,
      "end_ms": 374275,
      "text": "因为和平是手里的剑给的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00129",
      "start_ms": 375070,
      "end_ms": 376115,
      "text": "听完他的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00130",
      "start_ms": 376520,
      "end_ms": 377835,
      "text": "心里真的很感慨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00131",
      "start_ms": 378480,
      "end_ms": 379995,
      "text": "咱们现在安稳的日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00132",
      "start_ms": 380260,
      "end_ms": 381460,
      "text": "那是凭空来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00133",
      "start_ms": 381480,
      "end_ms": 383425,
      "text": "都是这一批国之先辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00134",
      "start_ms": 383900,
      "end_ms": 384865,
      "text": "吃苦受累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00135",
      "start_ms": 385190,
      "end_ms": 386365,
      "text": "咬牙扛出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00136",
      "start_ms": 387480,
      "end_ms": 388180,
      "text": "很多时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00137",
      "start_ms": 388180,
      "end_ms": 390040,
      "text": "我们生活里遇到点难处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00138",
      "start_ms": 390320,
      "end_ms": 391665,
      "text": "就容易觉得累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00139",
      "start_ms": 392010,
      "end_ms": 392805,
      "text": "觉得委屈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00140",
      "start_ms": 393420,
      "end_ms": 395025,
      "text": "回头看看这些先辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00141",
      "start_ms": 395500,
      "end_ms": 399025,
      "text": "他当年面临的是更大的苦难和抉择。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00142",
      "start_ms": 400100,
      "end_ms": 401185,
      "text": "读他们的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00143",
      "start_ms": 401420,
      "end_ms": 402765,
      "text": "不是单纯看历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00144",
      "start_ms": 403220,
      "end_ms": 404160,
      "text": "更是读懂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00145",
      "start_ms": 404180,
      "end_ms": 405285,
      "text": "什么叫骨气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00146",
      "start_ms": 405620,
      "end_ms": 406575,
      "text": "什么叫担当？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00147",
      "start_ms": 407670,
      "end_ms": 408885,
      "text": "这本国之几两？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00148",
      "start_ms": 409170,
      "end_ms": 416775,
      "text": "就在左下角链接里书里面记录的就是这些近代先辈们真实的人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00149",
      "start_ms": 418340,
      "end_ms": 419660,
      "text": "没事的时候翻一翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00150",
      "start_ms": 419720,
      "end_ms": 420985,
      "text": "不管是自己看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00151",
      "start_ms": 421350,
      "end_ms": 423215,
      "text": "家里孩子也可以读一读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00152",
      "start_ms": 423750,
      "end_ms": 426605,
      "text": "了解我们真正的民族榜样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00153",
      "start_ms": 427780,
      "end_ms": 430845,
      "text": "有需要的朋友直接拍下现货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00154",
      "start_ms": 431120,
      "end_ms": 431695,
      "text": "带回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eaf6c8ea1aac9864_s00155",
      "start_ms": 431990,
      "end_ms": 432775,
      "text": "慢慢品读。"
    }
  ],
